/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:73:  rule slStep(noB)          => 1
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:74:  rule slStep(someB(S:Int)) => S
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:75:
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:76:  syntax Int ::= slStart(OptInt, OptInt, Int) [function]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:77:  rule slStart(noB,          ST:OptInt, _LEN:Int) => 0
