  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics and independently reconstruct every proof claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and all K rules
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
